{
  "lines": [
    {
      "text": "Sam is replacing a legacy job that exports 40 accounts.",
      "file": "288c39e0c96a07a4.mp3",
      "seconds": 3.696,
      "engine": "espeak",
      "voice": "en-us",
      "sha256": "4f9577623ce341512f966ca34dc505400fb8bf255f34b8a722d14adf5ba76db0"
    },
    {
      "text": "Before switching, Sam has to show that the new export matches the old one.",
      "file": "d4f036df94f3fb00.mp3",
      "seconds": 4.296,
      "engine": "espeak",
      "voice": "en-us",
      "sha256": "92a3227ecc7fdcd2ec080f1106ec2f222f04deaea3371b3844050cf316a76731"
    },
    {
      "text": "Veridelta pairs the rows by account ID and compares each column.",
      "file": "f808fdd871ce4f90.mp3",
      "seconds": 3.984,
      "engine": "espeak",
      "voice": "en-us",
      "sha256": "4dd9951f0c4f8ff3fb2542d75a934bd7a4dc1987ce04be8f610d2d3fe3e27ef7"
    },
    {
      "text": "39 rows differ, and one account is missing.",
      "file": "d9458c964c6de006.mp3",
      "seconds": 3.024,
      "engine": "espeak",
      "voice": "en-us",
      "sha256": "018d0f17931b8b7629dcff0f3d4276e4ffc022535de9b2e2c3b620d88127de9c"
    },
    {
      "text": "In CI, exit code 1 fails the check. But is any of this a real error?",
      "file": "dcec4ae980bc2d13.mp3",
      "seconds": 4.656,
      "engine": "espeak",
      "voice": "en-us",
      "sha256": "c423b8a615c4a4e5e591cc6ab872dbfdaec9f3f0cedd701c99413e9e9a7c0321"
    },
    {
      "text": "Rules say which differences are expected, column by column.",
      "file": "a9f079175ad82c17.mp3",
      "seconds": 3.816,
      "engine": "espeak",
      "voice": "en-us",
      "sha256": "dcef8a754037df7547ee04afc36919697516a793d842262d4d9317ed50d6be76"
    },
    {
      "text": "Veridelta cleans each side by those rules, then reports whatever they do not explain.",
      "file": "c817697a0cec8067.mp3",
      "seconds": 5.28,
      "engine": "espeak",
      "voice": "en-us",
      "sha256": "de98d8a57e213e122b708c54ae730d9a1b14a22898004408a6957d73f1de9183"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sam does not have to guess the rules.",
      "file": "a350913d3dbf8fbe.mp3",
      "seconds": 2.04,
      "engine": "espeak",
      "voice": "en-us",
      "sha256": "52543c7589ff79e11c91258b199ec75132f0c51bed601136063ccfb829e051b5"
    },
    {
      "text": "veridelta suggest tries each kind of rule on the columns that differ.",
      "file": "2abfd10b3a9f1569.mp3",
      "seconds": 3.96,
      "engine": "espeak",
      "voice": "en-us",
      "sha256": "a248c104171f635af895ca0ea8aadf0542167ecccaecee48b1e958691c0d9349"
    },
    {
      "text": "It proposes three, each with the rows it explains, and calls no model.",
      "file": "b9303c67bc2be78c.mp3",
      "seconds": 4.488,
      "engine": "espeak",
      "voice": "en-us",
      "sha256": "526c4e237666122b5d31d4c7616d7fc75c4e8a86d89be53789786f79a30d5e37"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sam adds a map from the old status words to the new letters. The rules live in one file.",
      "file": "8e24ac93317cede8.mp3",
      "seconds": 5.4,
      "engine": "espeak",
      "voice": "en-us",
      "sha256": "1264e56dd9f919ae60503c75fb83edb664b2805155a141a43eb9f454e4bf11de"
    },
    {
      "text": "Now only two rows differ.",
      "file": "f8601e66c82f8566.mp3",
      "seconds": 1.488,
      "engine": "espeak",
      "voice": "en-us",
      "sha256": "e1ed51641c8b35a48bff1ee9a8fa92530b4ebcc051c34d3618b41b844865ee93"
    },
    {
      "text": "Rules forgive rounding, case, empty markers, renamed codes, dates, and types.",
      "file": "8acd8e72a4865c83.mp3",
      "seconds": 5.928,
      "engine": "espeak",
      "voice": "en-us",
      "sha256": "09e007309ade0d8fdec613d3e9940403244ffa1af166fdef6e046659b45cb133"
    },
    {
      "text": "They cannot do arithmetic, like rounding to a multiple of seven, or compare two columns.",
      "file": "8c94d415d617d5b5.mp3",
      "seconds": 5.28,
      "engine": "espeak",
      "voice": "en-us",
      "sha256": "3c5d50391c952353a18c60863fcd2b0558c613c9acb41e9ae605bbf148c00ad6"
    },
    {
      "text": "Account 40 was closed on purpose, so a baseline file accepts it.",
      "file": "fc2a798130335ad0.mp3",
      "seconds": 4.464,
      "engine": "espeak",
      "voice": "en-us",
      "sha256": "c7095a59d1fde589bb869904c68c2efa835b3da53e70dde6e478b13ff0cbf296"
    },
    {
      "text": "The run accepts it, and one row still differs.",
      "file": "c3123430dc99d4c0.mp3",
      "seconds": 2.904,
      "engine": "espeak",
      "voice": "en-us",
      "sha256": "a0f5ee76b5922dea94808132fc6650c13120fa42f49bef44e58bc61fed636c31"
    },
    {
      "text": "So CI holds the rewrite until that row is fixed.",
      "file": "a46166709d130508.mp3",
      "seconds": 3.024,
      "engine": "espeak",
      "voice": "en-us",
      "sha256": "e7da72c6ae4824b6f1934d353b9a7bc30376a7f4f5192f135998f2ad18285465"
    },
    {
      "text": "The report shows that row side by side. Account 17 moved from south to east.",
      "file": "bb4ffa633672ee6c.mp3",
      "seconds": 5.208,
      "engine": "espeak",
      "voice": "en-us",
      "sha256": "20c072234e9762f944f0a62978d938e198d96cd11a4645cc825de87826dbf560"
    },
    {
      "text": "That is the real error, out of 40 differences.",
      "file": "05c1a3f5ff7eb3ab.mp3",
      "seconds": 2.592,
      "engine": "espeak",
      "voice": "en-us",
      "sha256": "4ea4edfd85c9b3d7cb02dafa824ae84ceefad679a212ea811514a4b64cc08f13"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sam runs Veridelta in the terminal while writing the rules.",
      "file": "40b110d02307c538.mp3",
      "seconds": 3.192,
      "engine": "espeak",
      "voice": "en-us",
      "sha256": "92e2d041b58de89b19d18cd2a70ac622be1906373a357f9008e3e083e8c0dd00"
    },
    {
      "text": "Then the GitHub Action runs the same check on every pull request, and comments the result.",
      "file": "1163093218f8ffec.mp3",
      "seconds": 5.568,
      "engine": "espeak",
      "voice": "en-us",
      "sha256": "ecd5a7518272b22bea91de51c79a793116cfba24ebe638760e92ff1e5526da5c"
    },
    {
      "text": "Agents can call the same checks through MCP, and warehouse tables are compared where they are stored.",
      "file": "610c05825a5ab153.mp3",
      "seconds": 5.88,
      "engine": "espeak",
      "voice": "en-us",
      "sha256": "f851c9306ffe8ab07c484b861059b38e2f41e0056a02e31f61f472316f96158a"
    },
    {
      "text": "Veridelta is early, and tested on generated data.",
      "file": "e49252464731fb21.mp3",
      "seconds": 3.096,
      "engine": "espeak",
      "voice": "en-us",
      "sha256": "e51acafe5215b0226d6dc8c48c0b15e1d39df749ae14283b8b7a6cb48006db2c"
    },
    {
      "text": "Feedback is welcome.",
      "file": "dfdb54a2cdc34418.mp3",
      "seconds": 1.272,
      "engine": "espeak",
      "voice": "en-us",
      "sha256": "9142540245885d0a7724b9aba144bb5f9b8f4fd0acbff2931100cc791513ea33"
    },
    {
      "text": "Try it with pip install veridelta.",
      "file": "68369ab5e8831991.mp3",
      "seconds": 2.04,
      "engine": "espeak",
      "voice": "en-us",
      "sha256": "62344c069a0d5bc0127c5d56854d5ba7d24b25e96b83b7ff8e2c5175d33f00ee"
    }
  ]
}
